message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below. Reuse of the code needs the author's written permission (see LICENSE)."
type: software
title: "Iran Flood Watch: ensemble flood early warning for Iran"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
authors:
  - family-names: Abbasalizadehrezaei
    given-names: Parisa
    website: "https://risarezaei.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RisaRezaei/iran-flood-watch"
url: "https://risarezaei.github.io/iran-flood-watch/"
license-url: "https://github.com/RisaRezaei/iran-flood-watch/blob/main/LICENSE"
abstract: >-
  Flood early-warning dashboard for Iran covering 29 river reaches and
  27 flash-flood-prone cities. River warnings compare GloFAS v4 ensemble
  discharge forecasts (51 members, 30 days) with Gumbel return levels of the
  model's own climate; rainfall warnings compare ECMWF IFS ensemble 1-day and
  3-day totals with ERA5 return levels. Updates hourly when a new model run is
  available.
keywords:
  - flood early warning
  - Iran
  - GloFAS
  - ECMWF ensemble
  - flash floods
  - return period
